{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Fight the bug invasion with Bug Cleaners Demo! This demo lets you fully experience one complete section of the main game. Take on chaotic missions solo or with up to 4 players and use your flamethrowers, bug spray machines, and your helper Sniffers to stop the invasion. Absurd humor, crazy missions, and spotless areas await you. Let\u2019s go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1b <strong>Bugs everywhere</strong><br>It\u2019s time to clean them up. Form your team or dive in solo and stop the invasion<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/363e25a5f43c3f15747758aae5ba8f58.poster.avif?t=1756294973\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/363e25a5f43c3f15747758aae5ba8f58.webm?t=1756294973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Torch it</strong><br>Use the power of flames to scorch the invaders<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/0ef2e1099c3ec1810f50cdd529abdfff.poster.avif?t=1756294973\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/0ef2e1099c3ec1810f50cdd529abdfff.webm?t=1756294973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd9f <strong>Spray with the bug machine</strong><br>Force the bugs to vanish into the toxic mist<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/2a2c02dec83163f8773d5174c451e41a.poster.avif?t=1756294973\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/2a2c02dec83163f8773d5174c451e41a.webm?t=1756294973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Vacuum with the suction machine</strong><br>Suck them all up at once and leave the area spotless<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/d553ca02a5214ffabcc5318e28da8b23.poster.avif?t=1756294973\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/d553ca02a5214ffabcc5318e28da8b23.webm?t=1756294973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Detect bugs with your trained cat Sniffers</strong><br>Sniffers can sense bugs wherever it sniffs. With its alerts every corner is ready to be cleaned. A fast and reliable helper always by your side<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/a7239d0ee35333b1925f4515ef16e318.poster.avif?t=1756294973\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3559670/extras/a7239d0ee35333b1925f4515ef16e318.webm?t=1756294973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc63 <strong>Stick bugs with your hands or stomp them with your feet</strong><br>Sometimes getting the job done means sticking bugs in one go and crushing them mercilessly with your feet. End for the bugs and relief for you<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anony